Always preserve production behavior.

Never break:

- Authentication
- Authorization
- Supabase RLS
- API routes
- Checkout flow
- Ecotrack integration
- CSP
- Security headers

Always:

- search existing code first
- reuse components
- avoid duplication
- keep TypeScript strict
- keep lint/build passing

Before implementing:

1. explain root cause
2. explain implementation
3. list affected files

After implementing:

- verify imports
- verify types
- verify build compatibility

Never fabricate database tables, APIs, environment variables or third-party SDKs.